{
  "about": [
    "Race regressions of the root-run mutations (PLAN.md 4.5, R12; slice H1), run by both guards:",
    "tests/test_echoport_remote_command_guard.py (GuardMutationRaces, the Python guard) and",
    "tests/mutations.rs (the Rust guard) read this file and must reach the same outcome.",
    "",
    "Each scenario builds `tree` in a fresh temporary directory {base} (its canonical path), runs",
    "`setup`, then check() of `command` with the real filesystem under the policy",
    "{\"path_roots\": [{\"path\": \"{root}\", \"owner\": \"{owner}\"}]} (or takes `mutation` as it is),",
    "then `before_use` (a change between check and use), then perform() with a test hook that runs",
    "the actions of each `hooks` entry once, at the nth call with that event and path (events:",
    "dir = a directory on the way was opened, stat = an entry passed lstat and is about to be opened).",
    "`expect` is {\"done\": true}, {\"refused\": <reason>}, {\"refused_prefix\": <start of the reason>}",
    "or {\"check_refused\": <reason of check()>}. `after` asserts the tree afterwards.",
    "",
    "{root} = {base}/root is the policy root, {outside} = {base}/outside is outside it. {owner} is",
    "<user>:<group> of the test: the test user and another group of theirs (as root: nobody:nogroup).",
    "Actions: [mkdir, p], [file, p] (content new), [fifo, p], [fifo_hex, dir, hexname],",
    "[link, p, target], [hardlink, p, existing], [remove, p] (a file or link), [rename, a, b],",
    "[chmod, p, mode], [replace_with_link, p, target] (rename p to p.orig, then link p to target).",
    "Assertions: [mode, p, mode], [owner, p, new|old] (new: the uid/gid of {owner}; old: as before",
    "check()), [exists, p], [absent, p], [file, p], [dir, p], [link, p, target], [content, p, text]",
    "(the tree's files hold their relative path). `platforms` limits a scenario (non-UTF-8 names:",
    "linux). Events of the hook: dir, stat, and rename (right before mv renames, path = target).",
    "perform() is called directly, as the test user (root in the Layer-2 containers); the guard's",
    "main() drops to the root's owner first for chmod, mv and rm (Layer 3, molecule). The scenario",
    "chown-recursive-subdir-moved-out-after-open pins the accepted chown residual (PLAN.md 4.5): an",
    "entry the guard reached through the root is changed even if its directory is renamed away."
  ],
  "tree": {
    "dirs": [
      ["root", "0755"], ["root/dir", "0755"], ["root/dir/sub", "0755"], ["root/media", "0755"],
      ["root/media/a", "0755"], ["root/snap", "0700"], ["outside", "0755"], ["outside/dir", "0755"]
    ],
    "files": [
      ["root/db", "0644"], ["root/db-wal", "0644"], ["root/db-shm", "0644"], ["root/db.tmp", "0644"],
      ["root/dir/f", "0644"], ["root/dir/db-wal", "0644"], ["root/dir/db-shm", "0644"],
      ["root/dir/sub/g", "0644"], ["root/media/top", "0644"], ["root/media/a/x", "0644"],
      ["outside/secret", "0644"], ["outside/dir/f", "0644"], ["outside/dir/db-wal", "0644"],
      ["outside/dir/db-shm", "0644"]
    ]
  },
  "scenarios": [
    {"id": "chmod-file", "command": "chmod 0600 {root}/db",
     "expect": {"done": true}, "after": [["mode", "{root}/db", "0600"]]},
    {"id": "chmod-dir", "command": "chmod 0700 {root}/dir",
     "expect": {"done": true}, "after": [["mode", "{root}/dir", "0700"]]},
    {"id": "chmod-final-link-before-use", "command": "chmod 0600 {root}/db",
     "before_use": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/db", "{outside}/secret"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "chmod target is a symbolic link: '{root}/db'"},
     "after": [["mode", "{outside}/secret", "0644"], ["link", "{root}/db", "{outside}/secret"]]},
    {"id": "chmod-parent-link-before-use", "command": "chmod 0600 {root}/dir/f",
     "before_use": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/dir", "{outside}/dir"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "symbolic link in the path: '{root}/dir'"},
     "after": [["mode", "{outside}/dir/f", "0644"]]},
    {"id": "chmod-parent-link-during-walk", "command": "chmod 0600 {root}/dir/f",
     "hooks": [{"event": "dir", "path": "{root}", "actions": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/dir", "{outside}/dir"]]}],
     "expect": {"refused": "symbolic link in the path: '{root}/dir'"},
     "after": [["mode", "{outside}/dir/f", "0644"], ["mode", "{root}/dir.orig/f", "0644"]]},
    {"id": "chmod-final-link-during-walk", "command": "chmod 0600 {root}/db",
     "hooks": [{"event": "stat", "path": "{root}/db", "actions": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/db", "{outside}/secret"]]}],
     "expect": {"refused": "chmod target is a symbolic link: '{root}/db'"},
     "after": [["mode", "{outside}/secret", "0644"]]},
    {"id": "chmod-final-replaced-during-walk", "command": "chmod 0600 {root}/db",
     "hooks": [{"event": "stat", "path": "{root}/db", "actions": [["rename", "{root}/db.tmp", "{root}/db"]]}],
     "expect": {"refused": "chmod target was replaced: '{root}/db'"},
     "after": [["mode", "{root}/db", "0644"]]},
    {"id": "chmod-hard-link", "command": "chmod 0600 {root}/db",
     "setup": [["remove", "{root}/db"], ["hardlink", "{root}/db", "{outside}/secret"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "chmod target has other hard links: '{root}/db'"},
     "after": [["mode", "{outside}/secret", "0644"]]},
    {"id": "chmod-fifo", "command": "chmod 0600 {root}/pipe",
     "setup": [["fifo", "{root}/pipe"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "chmod target is not a regular file or directory: '{root}/pipe'"}},
    {"id": "chmod-link-inside-the-root", "command": "chmod 0600 {root}/alias",
     "setup": [["link", "{root}/alias", "{root}/db"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "chmod target is a symbolic link: '{root}/alias'"},
     "after": [["mode", "{root}/db", "0644"]]},
    {"id": "chmod-root-through-a-link", "command": "chmod 0600 {base}/alias/db",
     "setup": [["link", "{base}/alias", "{root}"]],
     "expect": {"check_refused": "path not inside its root as written: '{base}/alias/db'"},
     "after": [["mode", "{root}/db", "0644"]]},
    {"id": "chmod-missing", "command": "chmod 0600 {root}/gone",
     "expect": {"refused": "cannot stat: '{root}/gone': No such file or directory"}},

    {"id": "chown-file", "command": "chown {owner} {root}/db",
     "expect": {"done": true}, "after": [["owner", "{root}/db", "new"]]},
    {"id": "chown-final-link-before-use", "command": "chown {owner} {root}/db",
     "before_use": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/db", "{outside}/secret"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "chown target is a symbolic link: '{root}/db'"},
     "after": [["owner", "{outside}/secret", "old"]]},
    {"id": "chown-parent-link-before-use", "command": "chown {owner} {root}/dir/f",
     "before_use": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/dir", "{outside}/dir"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "symbolic link in the path: '{root}/dir'"},
     "after": [["owner", "{outside}/dir/f", "old"], ["owner", "{outside}/dir", "old"]]},
    {"id": "chown-final-link-during-walk", "command": "chown {owner} {root}/db",
     "hooks": [{"event": "stat", "path": "{root}/db", "actions": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/db", "{outside}/secret"]]}],
     "expect": {"refused": "chown target is a symbolic link: '{root}/db'"},
     "after": [["owner", "{outside}/secret", "old"]]},
    {"id": "chown-hard-link", "command": "chown {owner} {root}/db",
     "setup": [["remove", "{root}/db"], ["hardlink", "{root}/db", "{outside}/secret"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "chown target has other hard links: '{root}/db'"},
     "after": [["owner", "{outside}/secret", "old"]]},
    {"id": "chown-recursive", "command": "chown -R {owner} {root}/media",
     "setup": [["link", "{root}/media/a/out", "{outside}/secret"], ["link", "{root}/media/escape", "{outside}/dir"]],
     "expect": {"done": true},
     "after": [["owner", "{root}/media", "new"], ["owner", "{root}/media/a", "new"], ["owner", "{root}/media/a/x", "new"],
               ["owner", "{root}/media/top", "new"], ["owner", "{outside}/secret", "old"], ["owner", "{outside}/dir", "old"],
               ["owner", "{outside}/dir/f", "old"], ["link", "{root}/media/a/out", "{outside}/secret"],
               ["link", "{root}/media/escape", "{outside}/dir"], ["owner", "{root}/db", "old"]]},
    {"id": "chown-recursive-top-link-before-use", "command": "chown -R {owner} {root}/media",
     "before_use": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/media", "{outside}/dir"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "chown target is a symbolic link: '{root}/media'"},
     "after": [["owner", "{outside}/dir", "old"], ["owner", "{outside}/dir/f", "old"]]},
    {"id": "chown-recursive-subdir-link-during-walk", "command": "chown -R {owner} {root}/media",
     "hooks": [{"event": "stat", "path": "{root}/media/a", "actions": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/media/a", "{outside}/dir"]]}],
     "expect": {"refused": "chown target is a symbolic link: '{root}/media/a'"},
     "after": [["owner", "{outside}/dir", "old"], ["owner", "{outside}/dir/f", "old"], ["owner", "{root}/media", "new"]]},
    {"id": "chown-recursive-subdir-moved-after-open", "command": "chown -R {owner} {root}/media",
     "hooks": [{"event": "stat", "path": "{root}/media/a/x",
                "actions": [["rename", "{root}/media/a", "{root}/media/a2"], ["link", "{root}/media/a", "{outside}/dir"]]}],
     "expect": {"done": true},
     "after": [["owner", "{root}/media/a2/x", "new"], ["owner", "{outside}/dir", "old"], ["owner", "{outside}/dir/f", "old"]]},
    {"id": "chown-recursive-subdir-moved-out-after-open", "command": "chown -R {owner} {root}/media",
     "hooks": [{"event": "stat", "path": "{root}/media/a/x", "actions": [["rename", "{root}/media/a", "{outside}/moved-a"]]}],
     "expect": {"done": true},
     "after": [["owner", "{outside}/moved-a/x", "new"], ["owner", "{outside}/secret", "old"], ["owner", "{outside}/dir/f", "old"]]},
    {"id": "chown-recursive-hard-link", "command": "chown -R {owner} {root}/media",
     "setup": [["hardlink", "{root}/media/hl", "{outside}/secret"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "chown target has other hard links: '{root}/media/hl'"},
     "after": [["owner", "{outside}/secret", "old"]]},
    {"id": "chown-recursive-names-in-byte-order", "platforms": ["linux"], "command": "chown -R {owner} {root}/media",
     "setup": [["file", "{root}/media/\u00e9"], ["fifo_hex", "{root}/media", "80"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "chown target is not a regular file or directory: '{root}/media/\\udc80'"},
     "after": [["owner", "{root}/media/top", "new"], ["owner", "{root}/media/\u00e9", "old"]]},
    {"id": "chown-recursive-fifo", "command": "chown -R {owner} {root}/media",
     "setup": [["fifo", "{root}/media/pipe"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "chown target is not a regular file or directory: '{root}/media/pipe'"}},
    {"id": "chown-private-dir", "mutation": {"op": "chown", "paths": ["{root}/snap"], "owner": "{owner}", "private": true},
     "expect": {"done": true}, "after": [["owner", "{root}/snap", "new"]]},
    {"id": "chown-private-dir-opened-up", "mutation": {"op": "chown", "paths": ["{root}/snap"], "owner": "{owner}", "private": true},
     "before_use": [["chmod", "{root}/snap", "0755"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "not a private directory: '{root}/snap'"},
     "after": [["owner", "{root}/snap", "old"]]},
    {"id": "chown-private-dir-link-before-use", "mutation": {"op": "chown", "paths": ["{root}/snap"], "owner": "{owner}", "private": true},
     "before_use": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/snap", "{outside}/dir"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "chown target is a symbolic link: '{root}/snap'"},
     "after": [["owner", "{outside}/dir", "old"]]},

    {"id": "mv-upload-into-place", "command": "mv {root}/db.tmp {root}/db",
     "expect": {"done": true}, "after": [["file", "{root}/db"], ["absent", "{root}/db.tmp"]]},
    {"id": "mv-upload-onto-a-link-to-a-dir", "command": "mv {root}/db.tmp {root}/db",
     "before_use": [["remove", "{root}/db"], ["link", "{root}/db", "{outside}/dir"]],
     "expect": {"done": true},
     "after": [["file", "{root}/db"], ["absent", "{outside}/dir/db.tmp"], ["absent", "{outside}/dir/db"]]},
    {"id": "mv-new-name", "command": "mv {root}/db {root}/db.old",
     "expect": {"done": true}, "after": [["file", "{root}/db.old"], ["absent", "{root}/db"]]},
    {"id": "mv-dir", "command": "mv {root}/media {root}/media.old",
     "expect": {"done": true}, "after": [["dir", "{root}/media.old"], ["absent", "{root}/media"]]},
    {"id": "mv-target-created-before-use", "command": "mv {root}/db {root}/db.old",
     "before_use": [["file", "{root}/db.old"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "mv target exists: '{root}/db.old'"},
     "after": [["file", "{root}/db"], ["content", "{root}/db.old", "new"]]},
    {"id": "mv-target-created-at-the-rename", "command": "mv {root}/db {root}/db.old",
     "hooks": [{"event": "rename", "path": "{root}/db.old", "actions": [["file", "{root}/db.old"]]}],
     "expect": {"refused": "mv target exists: '{root}/db.old'"},
     "after": [["content", "{root}/db", "root/db"], ["content", "{root}/db.old", "new"]]},
    {"id": "mv-dir-target-created-at-the-rename", "command": "mv {root}/media {root}/media.old",
     "hooks": [{"event": "rename", "path": "{root}/media.old", "actions": [["mkdir", "{root}/media.old"]]}],
     "expect": {"refused": "mv target exists: '{root}/media.old'"},
     "after": [["dir", "{root}/media"], ["dir", "{root}/media.old"], ["absent", "{root}/media.old/top"]]},
    {"id": "mv-source-parent-link-before-use", "command": "mv {root}/dir/f {root}/f2",
     "before_use": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/dir", "{outside}/dir"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "symbolic link in the path: '{root}/dir'"},
     "after": [["file", "{outside}/dir/f"], ["absent", "{root}/f2"]]},
    {"id": "mv-target-parent-link-before-use", "command": "mv {root}/db {root}/dir/db",
     "before_use": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/dir", "{outside}/dir"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "symbolic link in the path: '{root}/dir'"},
     "after": [["absent", "{outside}/dir/db"], ["file", "{root}/db"]]},
    {"id": "mv-target-parent-link-during-walk", "command": "mv {root}/db {root}/dir/db",
     "hooks": [{"event": "dir", "path": "{root}", "nth": 2, "actions": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/dir", "{outside}/dir"]]}],
     "expect": {"refused": "symbolic link in the path: '{root}/dir'"},
     "after": [["absent", "{outside}/dir/db"], ["file", "{root}/db"]]},
    {"id": "mv-target-parent-moved-after-open", "command": "mv {root}/db {root}/dir/db",
     "hooks": [{"event": "dir", "path": "{root}/dir", "actions": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/dir", "{outside}/dir"]]}],
     "expect": {"done": true},
     "after": [["file", "{root}/dir.orig/db"], ["absent", "{outside}/dir/db"], ["absent", "{root}/db"]]},
    {"id": "mv-source-missing", "command": "mv {root}/gone {root}/gone2",
     "expect": {"refused": "mv failed: '{root}/gone' -> '{root}/gone2': No such file or directory"}},

    {"id": "rm-side-files", "command": "rm -f {root}/db-wal {root}/db-shm",
     "expect": {"done": true}, "after": [["absent", "{root}/db-wal"], ["absent", "{root}/db-shm"], ["file", "{root}/db"]]},
    {"id": "rm-side-file-missing", "command": "rm -f {root}/db-wal {root}/db-shm",
     "setup": [["remove", "{root}/db-shm"]],
     "expect": {"done": true}, "after": [["absent", "{root}/db-wal"]]},
    {"id": "rm-directory-missing", "command": "rm -f {root}/gone/db-wal {root}/gone/db-shm",
     "expect": {"done": true}},
    {"id": "rm-final-link-before-use", "command": "rm -f {root}/db-wal {root}/db-shm",
     "before_use": [["remove", "{root}/db-wal"], ["link", "{root}/db-wal", "{outside}/secret"]],
     "expect": {"done": true},
     "after": [["absent", "{root}/db-wal"], ["file", "{outside}/secret"]]},
    {"id": "rm-parent-link-before-use", "command": "rm -f {root}/dir/db-wal {root}/dir/db-shm",
     "before_use": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/dir", "{outside}/dir"]],
     "expect": {"refused": "symbolic link in the path: '{root}/dir'"},
     "after": [["file", "{outside}/dir/db-wal"], ["file", "{outside}/dir/db-shm"]]},
    {"id": "rm-parent-link-during-walk", "command": "rm -f {root}/dir/db-wal {root}/dir/db-shm",
     "hooks": [{"event": "dir", "path": "{root}", "nth": 2, "actions": [["replace_with_link", "{root}/dir", "{outside}/dir"]]}],
     "expect": {"refused": "symbolic link in the path: '{root}/dir'"},
     "after": [["absent", "{root}/dir.orig/db-wal"], ["file", "{root}/dir.orig/db-shm"], ["file", "{outside}/dir/db-wal"],
               ["file", "{outside}/dir/db-shm"]]},
    {"id": "rm-a-directory", "command": "rm -f {root}/x-wal {root}/x-shm",
     "setup": [["mkdir", "{root}/x-wal"]],
     "expect": {"refused_prefix": "rm failed: '{root}/x-wal': "},
     "after": [["dir", "{root}/x-wal"]]}
  ]
}
